(1) Status's '6 worth a look' in large amber at the head spends the scarcity on end_turn noise. Set it as ink with one small amber lamp, and keep amber large only for 'late'.
(2) Afterglow is invisible in the details. Use a sage edge fading over 1.2s.
(3) Drop To do's separate time column where 'due tomorrow, 19:56' already says it.
(4) Close the wide gap in Home's LATER rows (who and #n should sit near the title), and keep the line solid all the way to LATER on the phone.

